WEBVTT

00:00:04.601 --> 00:00:09.101
First time: AGENCY sees a face and starts a 5-second eye scan by itself.

00:00:09.558 --> 00:00:14.558
Follow the light with your eyes. That is the only setup.

00:00:15.263 --> 00:00:17.225
Home: a few big choices. The blue dot is where the eyes are. Look at Food until its ring fills.

00:00:17.275 --> 00:00:23.275
Pick by looking. No hands, no clicks.

00:00:30.478 --> 00:00:34.978
AGENCY plans it and asks first, with every detail.

00:00:35.918 --> 00:00:39.918
Paying needs a second look at a different button.

00:00:45.569 --> 00:00:48.523
Done, and checked. Demo store: nothing real is bought.

00:00:48.573 --> 00:00:53.573
Lifeline: three long blinks call for help, from any screen.

00:00:53.700 --> 00:00:58.700
A short countdown first. Cancelling takes a longer look.
